{"id":"9fc9b27d11ad8e50333132e0181899d2494ad71f","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1245626","title":"这里技术向居多，有没有发现很多客户根本不懂技术，却能大把赚钱？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"kav2","excerpt":"职场话题 - @kav2 - 我经常向各种等级的老板推销 SAAS ，总会有一种油然而生的感觉，WTF 他为什么这都不懂还有顾客花大把钱买他的东西？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>我经常向各种等级的老板推销 SAAS ，总会有一种油然而生的感觉，WTF 他为什么这都不懂还有顾客花大把钱买他的东西？</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/技术\"><li></li> 技术</a><a href=\"/tag/客户\"><li></li> 客户</a><a href=\"/tag/商业\"><li></li> 商业</a></P><p><span>39 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-30 15:24:13 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139199\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a379fd7d63ee8779653d6b03badd076b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kneo\" data-uid=\"640670\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kneo\">kneo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 20:38:21 +08:00\">1 day ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 15</span>\n                    \n                    <p>如果一个搞技术的人搞不清楚技术和赚钱是两件事，那他就不是单纯的不懂赚钱。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139200\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/123c61567f3205faae3226fab99c1722?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yusf\" data-uid=\"615248\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yusf\">yusf</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 20:38:24 +08:00\">1 day ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>因为技术不值钱</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139204\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f276/35bc/201502_normal.png?m=1787298655\" alt=\"flypei\" data-uid=\"201502\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/flypei\">flypei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 20:39:56 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果懂技术就能赚钱，那么本站用户在当地至少的小富豪</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139214\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6cfd2a37f6a87929944a1bfefc6c97f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lscho\" data-uid=\"294493\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lscho\">lscho</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 20:44:09 +08:00\">1 day ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>干技术干魔怔了？技术只是赚钱能力之一，甚至是很不重要的之一。</p><p>赚钱的本质是别人愿意把钱给你，至于愿意给你的原因，多种多样，甚至有时候你什么都不需要做，合适的时间合适的位置，就有人把钱给你</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139215\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ec1ec0ab8c8ce76e614162b454b523f0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"calcoe\" data-uid=\"495032\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/calcoe\">calcoe</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 20:44:25 +08:00\">1 day ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>这还用发现吗，那些富豪有钱人没几个是搞技术出身的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139219\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6159/9999/582231_normal.png?m=1754617848\" alt=\"Nasdaq\" data-uid=\"582231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Nasdaq\">Nasdaq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 20:45:47 +08:00\">1 day ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>非核心科技技术一文不值（ AI 出来更是如此）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139220\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/abc3/7882/369668_normal.png?m=1789866428\" alt=\"SuperDaniel313\" data-uid=\"369668\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SuperDaniel313\">SuperDaniel313</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 20:45:49 +08:00\">1 day ago via Android</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>没准人家还笑你不懂商务/商业/营销呢🐶</p><p>站里技术大佬这么多，但真正懂基础财务的有多少呀？记账和报税之间的逻辑搞懂了哇？怎么合理避税知道哇？</p><p>我估计如果这些都不懂，然后去问那些代记账的，那代记账的也是以你看待这些老板的眼光来看待这些技术大佬。这些开公司的技术大佬怎么回事，连记账报税都不懂？这也能赚钱？</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139267\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c6a7919632a1797e1f075dc31ffb0e87?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sn0wdr1am\" data-uid=\"656196\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sn0wdr1am\">sn0wdr1am</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 21:07:48 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>牛也会更低，马可以日行千里，牛马懂技术，不代表懂赚钱。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139269\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c6a7919632a1797e1f075dc31ffb0e87?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sn0wdr1am\" data-uid=\"656196\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sn0wdr1am\">sn0wdr1am</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 21:08:00 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>牛也会耕地，马可以日行千里，牛马懂技术，不代表懂赚钱。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139279\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c8aa/4ff3/289604_normal.png?m=1536139358\" alt=\"yoshiyuki\" data-uid=\"289604\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yoshiyuki\">yoshiyuki</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 21:12:03 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>naive ，你没有理解最基本的聪明种类差异，世界上至少有几十种类型的聪明，<br>有街头聪明，有学术聪明，也有金钱聪明 money smart ，很简单很清楚的事，你遇到的这些企业主有 money smart ，你未知有没有</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139305\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d899/0f79/497554_normal.png?m=1659574575\" alt=\"iwh718\" data-uid=\"497554\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iwh718\">iwh718</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 21:30:46 +08:00\">1 day ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>賺錢和技術沒關係，两回事。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139309\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11c8a5ee510de6c35197072628b3b5c8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"01802\" data-uid=\"79205\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/01802\">01802</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 21:31:07 +08:00\">1 day ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>因为赚钱和技术没太大关系，更多是信息差的利用。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139315\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b238/af0c/287977_normal.png?m=1788405440\" alt=\"bofei\" data-uid=\"287977\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bofei\">bofei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 21:33:56 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你懂技术，你能保证你比老板赚的多嘛。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139373\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f06/6f8f/401678_normal.png?m=1770468392\" alt=\"levelworm\" data-uid=\"401678\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/levelworm\">levelworm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 22:01:14 +08:00\">1 day ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>赚钱和技术本来就没啥关系。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139388\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2fc1/5950/472493_normal.png?m=1584500692\" alt=\"agentd\" data-uid=\"472493\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/agentd\">agentd</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 22:05:50 +08:00\">1 day ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>技术甚至都不是赚钱的必要条件。技术牛逼更不是赚钱的必要条件。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139403\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8bfd/249e/593713_normal.png?m=1772590820\" alt=\"MindMindMax\" data-uid=\"593713\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MindMindMax\">MindMindMax</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 22:14:58 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你会用 改锥、螺丝刀、电钻甚至油锯，你努力给家具厂老板打工赚收入养家。<br>然而当你自己摆脱老板单干后发现：无法从客户那里赚什么钱</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139412\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b349/a1af/415096_normal.png?m=1618586856\" alt=\"lujiaosama\" data-uid=\"415096\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lujiaosama\">lujiaosama</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 22:21:34 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你能这么想就是为什么你赚不到钱的原因。钱就是钱，是不分高低贵贱的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139431\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5987/bc50/78391_normal.png?m=1788532163\" alt=\"yidinghe\" data-uid=\"78391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yidinghe\">yidinghe</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 22:36:31 +08:00\">23h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>懂技术又不能直接赚钱，除非是印钞技术。退一万步说，人类最早的赚钱职业，根本不需要技术。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139592\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e58f/8741/89411_normal.png?m=1641637802\" alt=\"NewYear\" data-uid=\"89411\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/NewYear\">NewYear</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 00:51:04 +08:00\">21h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>这个世界不缺技术和工人。</p><p>缺的是变现能力。</p><p>也就是说，缺老板，缺销售。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139596\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 00:55:50 +08:00\">21h 29m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>马云：你在找我？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139654\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4dfa/8c1c/38436_normal.png?m=1789163514\" alt=\"msg7086\" data-uid=\"38436\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/msg7086\">msg7086</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 02:55:02 +08:00\">19h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>别人的技术就不是技术吗？通下水道一次 200 美元人家也有技术的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139658\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d32a/2455/365515_normal.png?m=1781029422\" alt=\"honjow\" data-uid=\"365515\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/honjow\">honjow</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 03:03:59 +08:00\">19h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>技术和赚钱本来完全就是两回事啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139659\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/36eaa0be0ec8f196890c41dda85b66c6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cloudza\" data-uid=\"820343\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cloudza\">cloudza</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 03:10:05 +08:00\">19h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>技术和商业是两个完全不同的领域了，懂技术有懂商业的人并没你想的那么多....</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139697\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/396c65adceaa3d315f5710b90343b977?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"datocp\" data-uid=\"93383\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/datocp\">datocp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 06:34:58 +08:00\">15h 49m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>现在赚钱门槛高的很，<br>大家统一的国际标准，<br>每年客户来审核，<br>没有资质连门都迈不进去。</p><p>老板那叫战略，能给大家发工资用钱驱动技术就可以。懂技术的要忽悠投入少产出多，让老板钱包更大。。。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139711\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7aee/26c3/2719_normal.png?m=1783137169\" alt=\"loading\" data-uid=\"2719\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/loading\">loading</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 07:01:11 +08:00\">15h 23m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>对技术的理解太狭隘。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139789\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ffca59c5ffc890b3fd7065b5f93bf4ae?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"deplives\" data-uid=\"456093\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/deplives\">deplives</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 08:26:20 +08:00\">13h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你这给我看懵了？不懂技术就不能赚钱？不会养猪就不能做菜？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139817\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8b20/d54d/249925_normal.png?m=1714006617\" alt=\"aaronlau\" data-uid=\"249925\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aaronlau\">aaronlau</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 08:34:38 +08:00\">13h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你可以把 [赚钱] 类比成 [把妹] ，<br>妹子会因为你搬砖技术好就跟你耍吗？<br>有一说一，那些能持续赚钱的老板/个人，个人魅力比搬砖大佬不知要高多少。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139852\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/66aa/fc7e/403153_normal.png?m=1641565121\" alt=\"PbCopy111\" data-uid=\"403153\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/PbCopy111\">PbCopy111</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 08:45:46 +08:00\">13h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>追求的不一样，你要是想赚钱，就去做生意，但你喜欢技术，追求的是内心的祥和和稳定的人生，那就是高技术，学技术啊，这不是行行出状元么。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18140048\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/80cedebdb0fcaf30e0eab34485c185a1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"left7410\" data-uid=\"586088\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/left7410\">left7410</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 09:18:25 +08:00\">13h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>孙猴子、沙僧有技术，不过也就是一个挑担一个充当打手和保镖，唐僧骑着马啥也不干，到了西天依旧是功劳最高的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18140388\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2a7f/7d54/365070_normal.png?m=1706525539\" alt=\"zzzzzzggggggg\" data-uid=\"365070\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zzzzzzggggggg\">zzzzzzggggggg</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 10:02:37 +08:00\">12h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你对技术的理解太狭隘了，不是只有计算机技术才叫技术的，喝酒、情商、销售都是技术</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18140633\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/14319ff65b0c37ddeba2128ed9490428?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xx6412223\" data-uid=\"286154\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xx6412223\">xx6412223</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 10:34:12 +08:00\">11h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一套能卖出几百上千万的房子 VS 盖房子的民工</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141389\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7d14/624e/84985_normal.png?m=1706679947\" alt=\"Paladin\" data-uid=\"84985\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Paladin\">Paladin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 12:55:22 +08:00\">9h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>笑死，被代码洗脑了吧，核心是客户啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"我经常向各种等级的老板推销 SAAS ，总会有一种油然而生的感觉，WTF 他为什么这都不懂还有顾客花大把钱买他的东西？ 技术 客户 商业39 replies • 2026-09-30 15:24:13 +08:00 1 kneo 1 day ago 15 如果一个搞技术的人搞不清楚技术和赚钱是两件事，那他就不是单纯的不懂赚钱。 2 yusf 1 day ago 1 因为技术不值钱 3 flypei 1 day ago 如果懂技术就能赚钱，那么本站用户在当地至少的小富豪 4 lscho 1 day ago via Android 干技术干魔怔了？技术只是赚钱能力之一，甚至是很不重要的之一。赚钱的本质是别人愿意把钱给你，至于愿意给你的原因，多种多样，甚至有时候你什么都不需要做，合适的时间合适的位置，就有人把钱给你 5 calcoe 1 day ago 1 这还用发现吗，那些富豪有钱人没几个是搞技术出身的 6 Nasdaq 1 day ago 1 非核心科技技术一文不值（ AI 出来更是如此） 7 SuperDaniel313 1 day ago via Android 2 没准人家还笑你不懂商务/商业/营销呢🐶站里技术大佬这么多，但真正懂基础财务的有多少呀？记账和报税之间的逻辑搞懂了哇？怎么合理避税知道哇？我估计如果这些都不懂，然后去问那些代记账的，那代记账的也是以你看待这些老板的眼光来看待这些技术大佬。这些开公司的技术大佬怎么回事，连记账报税都不懂？这也能赚钱？ 8 sn0wdr1am 1 day ago 牛也会更低，马可以日行千里，牛马懂技术，不代表懂赚钱。 9 sn0wdr1am 1 day ago 牛也会耕地，马可以日行千里，牛马懂技术，不代表懂赚钱。 10 yoshiyuki 1 day ago naive ，你没有理解最基本的聪明种类差异，世界上至少有几十种类型的聪明，有街头聪明，有学术聪明，也有金钱聪明 money smart ，很简单很清楚的事，你遇到的这些企业主有 money smart ，你未知有没有 12 iwh718 1 day ago via Android 賺錢和技術沒關係，两回事。 13 01802 1 day ago via Android 因为赚钱和技术没太大关系，更多是信息差的利用。 14 bofei 1 day ago 你懂技术，你能保证你比老板赚的多嘛。 15 levelworm 1 day ago via iPhone 赚钱和技术本来就没啥关系。 16 agentd 1 day ago via iPhone 技术甚至都不是赚钱的必要条件。技术牛逼更不是赚钱的必要条件。 17 MindMindMax 1 day ago 你会用 改锥、螺丝刀、电钻甚至油锯，你努力给家具厂老板打工赚收入养家。然而当你自己摆脱老板单干后发现：无法从客户那里赚什么钱 19 lujiaosama 1 day ago 你能这么想就是为什么你赚不到钱的原因。钱就是钱，是不分高低贵贱的。 20 yidinghe PRO 23h 48m ago 懂技术又不能直接赚钱，除非是印钞技术。退一万步说，人类最早的赚钱职业，根本不需要技术。 22 NewYear 21h 33m ago 这个世界不缺技术和工人。缺的是变现能力。也就是说，缺老板，缺销售。 23 V2Try 21h 29m ago via iPhone 马云：你在找我？ 24 msg7086 19h 29m ago 别人的技术就不是技术吗？通下水道一次 200 美元人家也有技术的。 25 honjow 19h 20m ago 技术和赚钱本来完全就是两回事啊 26 cloudza 19h 14m ago 技术和商业是两个完全不同的领域了，懂技术有懂商业的人并没你想的那么多.... 27 datocp 15h 49m ago via Android 现在赚钱门槛高的很，大家统一的国际标准，每年客户来审核，没有资质连门都迈不进去。老板那叫战略，能给大家发工资用钱驱动技术就可以。懂技术的要忽悠投入少产出多，让老板钱包更大。。。 28 loading 15h 23m ago via Android 对技术的理解太狭隘。 29 deplives 13h 58m ago 你这给我看懵了？不懂技术就不能赚钱？不会养猪就不能做菜？ 30 aaronlau 13h 50m ago 你可以把 [赚钱] 类比成 [把妹] ，妹子会因为你搬砖技术好就跟你耍吗？有一说一，那些能持续赚钱的老板/个人，个人魅力比搬砖大佬不知要高多少。 31 PbCopy111 13h 39m ago 追求的不一样，你要是想赚钱，就去做生意，但你喜欢技术，追求的是内心的祥和和稳定的人生，那就是高技术，学技术啊，这不是行行出状元么。 33 left7410 13h 6m ago 孙猴子、沙僧有技术，不过也就是一个挑担一个充当打手和保镖，唐僧骑着马啥也不干，到了西天依旧是功劳最高的 35 zzzzzzggggggg 12h 22m ago 你对技术的理解太狭隘了，不是只有计算机技术才叫技术的，喝酒、情商、销售都是技术 36 xx6412223 11h 50m ago 一套能卖出几百上千万的房子 VS 盖房子的民工 38 Paladin 9h 29m ago 笑死，被代码洗脑了吧，核心是客户啊","fetched_at":"2026-09-30T14:24:55.082Z","ok":true}